# 🌾 SmartMandi - Frontend Application (PWA)

**Smart India Hackathon (SIH 2026) Submission**  
**Problem Statement ID:** 26032  
**Team Name:** The Intruders  

This repository contains the frontend client for the **SmartMandi** ecosystem. Built as a Progressive Web App (PWA) using React.js, it provides a highly accessible, dual-interface platform designed for both rural farmers and mandi operators.

---

## ✨ Key Frontend Features & UI Innovations

*   **Progressive Web App (PWA):** Installable on mobile devices with optimized performance for low-bandwidth rural networks. 
*   **Multi-Lingual Voice Bot Support:** An inclusive voice-navigated UI that enables elderly and non-tech-savvy farmers to book slots, check queues, and get MSP updates without needing digital literacy.
*   **Real-Time Live Dashboard:** Integrates `Socket.io-client` to display zero-refresh queue positions and dynamic Estimated Time of Arrival (ETA) timers on the farmer's screen.
*   **Geofence Verification UI:** Prompts and securely fetches the user's GPS coordinates (`lat/lng`) to validate their physical presence within the 800m Mandi radius before allowing check-in.
*   **Smart QR Scanner (Operator Portal):** Integrated camera scanner for operators to instantly verify farmer tokens at the gate and update the 4:1 dynamic walk-in queue.
*   **Intuitive Booking Engine:** A simplified, step-by-step UI for farmers to select dates and view transparent slot availability based on the backend capacity engine.

---

## 🛠️ Frontend Tech Stack

*   **Core Library:** React.js
*   **Real-Time Engine:** Socket.io-client
*   **State Management:** React Context API / Redux (Update as per your project)
*   **Routing:** React Router DOM
*   **Styling:** CSS3 / Tailwind CSS (Update as per your project)
*   **Deployment/Build:** Vite / Create React App

---

## ⚙️ Prerequisites

*   [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/en/) (v18.0.0 or higher)
*   Make sure the [SmartMandi Backend Server](https://github.com/Rahul-college-use/SIH-26032-SmartMandi-Backend) is running locally or deployed.

---

